  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Calculate $(-12.8)÷1.6.$",
  "worked_solution": "Dividing a negative number by a positive number gives a negative number. Hence, the result will be negative.\n\nTherefore, since \n\n$$\n12.8÷1.6=8,\n$$\n\nwe obtain\n\n$$\n(-12.8)÷1.6=-8.\n$$",
